WEBVTT

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:02.877
Every filmmaker knows this feeling.

00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:11.822
You're alone. The light is perfect…

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:17.464
and then… it isn't.

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:24.259
A cloud. A door. A setting sun. And the moment is gone.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:28.048
Unless someone is watching the light… with you.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:34.373
It reads every stop. It moves when the light moves. And it tells you why.

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:39.790
You frame the shot. It handles the light.

00:00:49.100 --> 00:00:51.570
Exposure… handled.
